abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark of LLM agents that write programs over typed primitives for a
  simulated UR5e arm (ROS 2 Jazzy, Gazebo Harmonic), with a pre-registered evaluation of
  skill reuse and energy information (protocol f9-v1).
